Package: shriiipsy
Type: Package
Title: SHRIII Psychometrics Backend (Invariance, IRT, DIF, Mixed Models, Norming)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SHRIII", "Research Engineering", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "research-eng@shriii.invalid")
Description: The R side of the SHRIII validation engine (plan VAL-01, VAL-04, VAL-05, VAL-07, VAL-08a,
    VAL-08, VAL-09, VAL-11). Multi-group CFA measurement invariance (configural, thresholds, metric,
    scalar, strict) with lavaan and semTools including WLSMV for ordinal items, change-in-fit decision
    rules and a pre-registered partial invariance search; graded response models and likelihood-ratio
    IRT DIF with anchor selection (mirt); ordinal logistic DIF (lordif); explanatory IRT / GLMM DIF for
    trial-level game data (lme4, glmmTMB); logistic mixed models for person random slopes and their
    model-based reliability; weighted continuous norming (cNORM, GAMLSS); ICC, alpha and correlation
    cross-checks (irr, psych); Bayesian approximate invariance (blavaan). Exposed as a JSON-in /
    JSON-out command line over Parquet or CSV inputs, returning typed results with estimate, CI, n,
    method, warnings and provenance.
